      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 01.743  Flash 17</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Fred W. Van Sant, X 17, Extra Designs 1999</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Released into the public domain in memory of Charles L. Moon</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.720</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="302">109 facets + 24 girdles</tspan>
